# Credential material — never commit any of this.
# The real values live outside the repo (loaded by scripts/env.sh) and are
# injected into the container at runtime by the Infisical entrypoint.
.infisical
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.gpg
*.pem
*.key
*credentials*
*secret*

# Build-generated. Produced inside Docker and regenerated on every build;
# scripts/sync-generated.sh copies them out purely so gopls can resolve the tree.
internal/web/app.css
**/*_templ.go
node_modules/

# Runtime data — the SQLite file, its WAL, rendered audio, uploaded samples.
data/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.wav

# Local agent and tooling state. `.goals/` holds the phase-by-phase goal prompts
# and the brief/recon they are grounded in — working notes, kept out of the
# published repo. The plan of record lives in the Outline brain.
.goals/
.outline/
.serena/
.codegraph/
.tokensave/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
